\">Job 31:22</ref> (<bdbheb>מִקָּנָה</bdbheb>), and (in metaphor) <ref ref=\"Jer 48:25\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,25)\">Jer 48:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 38:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,15)\">Job 38:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 37:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,37,17)\">Ps 37:17</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 30:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,30,22)\">Ezek 30:22</ref>, bough <ref ref=\"Ezek 31:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,31,12)\">Ezek 31:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 27:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,11)\">Isa 27:11</ref>, compare (figurative) of wickedness, like a tree <ref ref=\"Job 24:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,20)\">Job 24:20</ref>, other things <ref ref=\"Ps 37:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,37,15)\">Ps 37:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,23)\">Jer 50:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 29:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,29,7)\">Ezek 29:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 124:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"124\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"124\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,124,7)\">Ps 124:7</ref> cisterns <ref ref=\"Jer 2:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,13)\">Jer 2:13</ref> (<highlight>id.</highlight>), pottery <ref ref=\"Lev 6:21\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,21)\">Lev 6:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 15:12\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(3,15,12)\">Lev 15:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:6\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,6)\">Eccl 12:6</ref> (in figurative); = <highlight>be maimed, crippled</highlight> (have limb broken), of animal <ref ref=\"Exod 22:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,22,9)\">Exod 22:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 22:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,22,13)\">Exod 22:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), and (figurative) <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,4)\">Ezek 34:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,16)\">Ezek 34:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 11:16\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,16)\">Zech 11:16</ref>, so (figurative of men stumbling) <ref ref=\"Isa 8:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,15)\">Isa 8:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 28:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,13)\">Isa 28:13</ref> <highlight>be wrecked</highlight>, of ships <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:49\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,49)\">1Kgs 22:49</ref> (read <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>נִשְׁבְּרוּ</bdbheb>), || <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:37\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,37)\">2Chr 20:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jonah 1:4\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(32,1,4)\">Jonah 1:4</ref>, metaphor of Tyre <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:34\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,34)\">Ezek 27:34</ref> figurative be <highlight>crushed</highlight>, destroyed (person, warriors, kingdoms, etc.), <ref ref=\"Jer 14:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,17)\">Jer 14:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 22:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,22,20)\">Jer 22:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 48:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,4)\">Jer 48:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 51:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,8)\">Jer 51:8</ref> + 10 t.; figurative <highlight>be broken</highlight>, of heart <ref ref=\"Jer 23:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,9)\">Jer 23:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 61:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,61,1)\">Isa 61:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 34:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,34,19)\">Ps 34:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 51:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,19)\">Ps 51:19</ref>, compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רוּחַ נִשׁ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ps 34:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,34,19)\">Ps 34:19</ref>. — <ref ref=\"Exod 6:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,6,9)\">Exod 6:9</ref> read probably <bdbheb>וְשָֽׁבַרְתִּ֫י</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sm')\">Sm</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Berthol')\">Berthol</lookup> Toy <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Krae')\">Krae</lookup>); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> <bdbheb>בְּשָׁבְרִי</bdbheb>. <b>Pi`el</b><sub>36</sub> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>שִׁבַּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 21:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,21,9)\">Isa 21:9</ref> +, <bdbheb>שִׁבֵּ֑ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 9:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,25)\">Exod 9:25</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יְשַׁבֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 46:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,46,10)\">Ps 46:10</ref> +, 2 masculine plural <bdbheb>תְּשַׁבֵּר֑וּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 34:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,13)\">Exod 34:13</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>שַׁבֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,24)\">Exod 23:24</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְשַׁבֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,11)\">1Kgs 19:11</ref> — <highlight>shatter, break</highlight>, tablets <ref ref=\"Exod 32:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,19)\">Exod 32:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Exod 34:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,1)\">Exod 34:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 9:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,17)\">Deut 9:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 10:2\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,2)\">Deut 10:2</ref> <bdbheb>מַצֵּבוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,24)\">Exod 23:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; + Infinitive absolute), <ref ref=\"Exod 34:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,13)\">Exod 34:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) + 7 t.; images <ref ref=\"2Kgs 11:18\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(12,11,18)\">2Kgs 11:18</ref> + 3 t.; bronze sea, etc., <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,13)\">2Kgs 25:13</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,17)\">Jer 52:17</ref> horns <ref ref=\"Dan 8:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,7)\">Dan 8:7</ref> jaws <ref ref=\"Job 29:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,17)\">Job 29:17</ref> (in figurative); of hail <highlight>shattering</highlight> tree <ref ref=\"Exod 9:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,25)\">Exod 9:25</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), compare <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,11)\">1Kgs 19:11</ref> elsewhere subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <highlight>shattering</highlight> gate-bars, etc., weapons <ref ref=\"Isa 45:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,2)\">Isa 45:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 38:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,38,13)\">Isa 38:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 2:9\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,9)\">Lam 2:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 3:4\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,4)\">Lam 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 46:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,46,10)\">Ps 46:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 76:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"76\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"76\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,76,4)\">Ps 76:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 107:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,16)\">Ps 107:16</ref>, trees <ref ref=\"Ps 29:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,29,5)\">Ps 29:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 105:33\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,33)\">Ps 105:33</ref>, heads of <bdbheb>תַּנִּינִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 74:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,13)\">Ps 74:13</ref> <highlight>wrecking</highlight> ship <ref ref=\"Ps 48:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,48,8)\">Ps 48:8</ref>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>cause to break out</highlight>, i.e. <highlight>bring to the birth</highlight>, <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 1 singular <bdbheb>הַאֲנִי אַשְׁבִּיר וְלֹא אוֺלִיד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 66:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,9)\">Isa 66:9</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> subject; compare <bdbheb>מַשְׁבֵּר</bdbheb> below). <b>Hoph`al</b> <highlight>be broken, shattered</highlight> (in heart), <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 1 singular <bdbheb>עַלשֶֿׁבֶר בַּתעַֿמִּי הָשְׁבַּ֑רְתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 8:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,21)\">Jer 8:21</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Kgs 13:28", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 13, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Isa 14:5", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Jer 19:11", "book": "JER", "chapter": 19, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Isa 42:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 42, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Prov 25:15", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 25, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Ps 10:15", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Jer 17:18", "book": "JER", "chapter": 17, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Gen 19:9", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 19, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Jer 28:12", "book": "JER", "chapter": 28, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Ezek 4:16", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 4, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Lev 22:22", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 22, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ps 147:3", "book": "PSA",